WEBVTT

01:40.000 --> 01:42.560
Perfect. Keep that.

01:42.640 --> 01:45.200
Show your teeth, please.

01:45.800 --> 01:47.400
Yes. Very good.

01:47.480 --> 01:48.440
That's right.

01:51.000 --> 01:52.360
Okay, perfect.

01:54.440 --> 01:55.840
The shooting is over.

01:55.920 --> 01:56.840
Thanks, everyone.

01:56.920 --> 01:58.280
- Great!
- Great!

02:04.440 --> 02:05.320
Thanks.

02:05.400 --> 02:06.800
We checked the photos on the computer.

02:06.880 --> 02:08.400
They were great.

02:08.479 --> 02:10.160
Thanks to Tang Qi's persistence,

02:10.240 --> 02:13.160
we didn't miss you, the rare treasure.

02:13.240 --> 02:14.040
Indeed.

02:14.120 --> 02:16.280
It has nothing to do with Tang Qi.

02:20.040 --> 02:22.640
Absolutely nothing.

02:27.520 --> 02:30.600
I came because of Su Chengcheng.

02:32.480 --> 02:34.800
She was kind and generous,

02:34.880 --> 02:37.320
so I agreed to be your model.

02:37.400 --> 02:41.760
If it weren't for her persistent effort,

02:42.640 --> 02:44.160
I couldn't have completed the shooting.

02:51.320 --> 02:53.840
Su Chengcheng is a new intern
of the Marketing Department.

02:54.520 --> 02:55.800
Intern?

02:57.800 --> 03:00.280
She's a talent. Give her a position.

03:01.560 --> 03:02.520
Okay.

03:04.320 --> 03:05.200
Thanks.

03:05.800 --> 03:08.080
I'll thank you on her behalf.

03:08.160 --> 03:09.240
You're too polite.

03:10.360 --> 03:12.000
But I've only seen your kindness,
generosity,

03:12.080 --> 03:14.280
and persistent effort, Ms. Su Miao.

03:15.880 --> 03:18.880
I haven't seen Su Chengcheng for an hour.

03:24.400 --> 03:25.400
Where is she?

03:26.080 --> 03:26.920
No idea.

03:28.520 --> 03:31.000
Well, I need to get changed.

03:36.040 --> 03:37.000
Su Miao!

03:38.800 --> 03:39.880
Su Miao.

03:41.440 --> 03:42.400
What's the matter?

03:43.640 --> 03:45.400
Mr. Zhou will treat us to dinner.

03:45.480 --> 03:47.600
I'm inviting you on behalf of my company.

03:53.560 --> 03:54.680
Sorry.

03:54.760 --> 03:56.920
I'm a little tired. I can't come.

03:59.880 --> 04:01.640
Oh, you must be tired
after working all day.

04:02.640 --> 04:03.560
Sorry, my bad.

04:04.360 --> 04:05.440
You should go home early.

04:11.040 --> 04:12.040
Scum.

04:12.920 --> 04:14.000
Rest early.

04:37.240 --> 04:39.240
Come on. Let's put work aside.

04:40.160 --> 04:42.400
Thank you for your effort.

04:42.480 --> 04:45.480
In return, I'll treat you to dinner.

04:45.560 --> 04:47.800
One condition. You must have fun!

04:47.880 --> 04:49.480
- Okay!
- Okay!

04:49.560 --> 04:50.720
It's amazing.

04:50.800 --> 04:51.640
Our boss is so generous!

04:51.720 --> 04:52.880
- Exactly.
- I'll eat more.

04:55.720 --> 04:56.960
Mr. Gu.

04:57.040 --> 04:59.000
Well, I'm a little tired.

04:59.080 --> 05:01.160
Maybe I can't have dinner with you.

05:01.240 --> 05:04.080
You must be tired after resting all day.

05:07.120 --> 05:09.880
As the newcomer,
you should use this opportunity

05:09.960 --> 05:11.600
to get to know your colleagues.

05:11.680 --> 05:12.880
Come with us.

05:12.960 --> 05:14.960
If you feel tired, just leave early.

05:17.400 --> 05:18.240
Okay.

05:29.600 --> 05:30.840
- Here.
- I have to toast to you.

05:30.920 --> 05:32.240
Hao, here's to you.

05:33.480 --> 05:34.680
- Have some meat.
- Thanks.

05:34.760 --> 05:36.840
Wang Yi, eat more.

05:36.920 --> 05:38.280
You did most of the work.

05:38.360 --> 05:39.800
You finished two people's work.

05:41.160 --> 05:42.280
Another one.

05:45.240 --> 05:46.600
Thanks. Have some meat.

05:48.200 --> 05:51.240
Su Chengcheng, when we were interns,

05:51.320 --> 05:53.000
we weren't as bold as you.

05:53.080 --> 05:56.040
You were absent at the shoot,
but you showed up at the restaurant.

06:01.360 --> 06:03.080
I'll toast to our new colleague
Su Chengcheng.

06:03.160 --> 06:04.200
- Mr. Gu.
- Mr. Gu.

06:04.280 --> 06:06.520
Thanks to you, we managed to hire Su Miao

06:06.600 --> 06:07.920
and complete the shooting.

06:08.000 --> 06:10.200
Oh, no. It's everyone's effort.

06:10.280 --> 06:11.400
Here's to you.

06:11.480 --> 06:12.400
So humble. Cheers.

06:12.480 --> 06:13.720
- Mr. Gu.
- Mr. Gu.

06:21.400 --> 06:22.360
Take your time.

06:26.400 --> 06:27.920
Come on.

06:28.000 --> 06:30.160
I'll toast to you as your colleague.

06:31.600 --> 06:32.640
If it weren't for you,

06:32.720 --> 06:35.760
today wouldn't have been
so fulfilling for me.

06:36.280 --> 06:38.320
Thanks. You must be tired.

06:45.880 --> 06:47.280
I'll toast to you too.

06:50.200 --> 06:52.000
When Wang Yi was busy,

06:52.080 --> 06:53.640
I helped her a few times.

06:53.720 --> 06:55.600
- Right, Wang Yi?
- Thanks.

07:07.440 --> 07:09.360
I helped her move the props.

07:09.440 --> 07:11.600
- Thanks.
- I helped too.

07:11.680 --> 07:13.520
- Thank you.
- It's okay.

07:13.600 --> 07:15.160
Then I'll apologize to all of you.

07:15.240 --> 07:16.240
I'll finish it first.

07:17.520 --> 07:19.480
- Finish!
- Come on!

07:22.720 --> 07:23.960
Tang, over here.

07:24.560 --> 07:25.720
Come on. Over here.

07:26.680 --> 07:28.200
Come on. Don't just eat.

07:28.280 --> 07:29.480
- Drink.
- You're late.

07:30.480 --> 07:31.600
Traffic jam.

07:31.680 --> 07:32.560
Come on.

07:32.640 --> 07:33.800
Let's drink. Cheers.

07:33.880 --> 07:35.400
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

07:36.640 --> 07:38.920
You're too slow.

07:39.000 --> 07:40.160
Give me your glasses.

07:40.240 --> 07:41.480
I haven't finished it.

07:41.560 --> 07:42.520
I'll fill it for you.

07:43.320 --> 07:45.120
The new colleague can drink a lot.

07:46.120 --> 07:47.280
- Come on, everyone.
- Come on.

07:47.360 --> 07:49.240
- Let's have another drink. Come on.
- Come on.

07:49.880 --> 07:50.800
What are you drinking?

07:51.840 --> 07:53.640
- He drinks water.
- Get him some beer.

07:53.720 --> 07:54.880
It's a good day. Don't worry.

07:54.960 --> 07:56.160
- Come on.
- Another one!

07:56.240 --> 07:58.040
- Another one! Cheers!
- Another one!

07:58.120 --> 07:59.600
Okay, cheers.

08:00.360 --> 08:01.760
- Let's drink.
- Just one glass.

08:01.840 --> 08:03.560
- Come on. Keep going.
- Come on.

08:05.960 --> 08:08.280
COME HERE MORE OFTEN
IT'S OUR PLEASURE TO HAVE YOU

08:08.360 --> 08:10.640
FREE WI-FI, WELCOME, LET'S DRINK

08:10.720 --> 08:12.360
FREE TO USE WI-FI

08:12.440 --> 08:15.800
WELCOME!

08:15.880 --> 08:19.680
DRINKING IS ALLOWED

08:20.280 --> 08:22.080
DEAR CHENG

08:26.600 --> 08:27.560
Hello, Chengcheng.

08:27.640 --> 08:29.800
Lin Yuan, can you pick me up?

08:29.880 --> 08:31.080
Are you drunk?

08:31.680 --> 08:32.640
No.

08:32.720 --> 08:34.640
I can drink a lot.

08:34.720 --> 08:36.320
I'm just a little dizzy.

08:37.520 --> 08:39.240
Send me the address. I'm coming.

08:55.200 --> 08:57.480
Mr. Tang. Dear boss.

08:58.200 --> 09:00.640
Are you not satisfied with me?

09:02.800 --> 09:04.720
Why should I be satisfied with you?

09:14.160 --> 09:16.480
I've done a lot,

09:16.560 --> 09:18.840
but I won't tell you.

09:19.520 --> 09:20.920
CLAY OVEN BARBECUE

09:29.800 --> 09:30.960
It's my turn.

09:31.040 --> 09:32.040
- Your turn.
- My turn.

09:34.280 --> 09:35.160
Hello?

09:36.280 --> 09:38.320
Well, here's my question.

09:38.920 --> 09:40.760
Who hasn't been in a relationship?

09:51.800 --> 09:53.320
Well, this…

09:54.400 --> 09:55.720
Who has been in a relationship?

09:55.800 --> 09:57.040
Well, I have.

10:11.160 --> 10:12.720
Congratulations, Tang Qi, Su Chengcheng.

10:12.800 --> 10:14.840
Please drink together.

10:14.920 --> 10:16.720
- Drink!
- Drink!

10:16.800 --> 10:17.640
Don't rush!

10:17.720 --> 10:20.480
- Drink!
- Drink!

10:20.560 --> 10:22.120
- Drink!
- Hey, stop!

10:22.200 --> 10:23.200
Listen to me.

10:23.280 --> 10:25.440
Well, we need to know

10:25.520 --> 10:27.680
- why they've stayed single, okay?
- Oh.

10:27.760 --> 10:29.240
Don't drink for nothing.

10:29.320 --> 10:30.520
- That's right.
- Yes.

10:30.600 --> 10:32.360
- Tell us.
- Chengcheng, tell us.

10:35.080 --> 10:41.160
Su Chengcheng! Su Chengcheng!
Su Chengcheng!

10:41.240 --> 10:42.840
Hey, wait.

10:42.920 --> 10:44.200
Gentleman first.

10:44.280 --> 10:45.240
Mr. Tang.

10:45.320 --> 10:48.520
Tell us why you've stayed single.

10:52.400 --> 10:55.600
I want to find my one and only,

10:56.640 --> 10:58.400
love her forever, and grow old with her,

10:59.040 --> 11:01.080
just like my parents do.

11:01.160 --> 11:03.840
Unfortunately, I haven't met her.

11:09.720 --> 11:13.640
Then your girlfriend must be
the luckiest person in the world.

11:14.240 --> 11:15.160
Yes.

11:19.080 --> 11:20.520
Stop bragging.

11:20.600 --> 11:22.240
You only care about appearance.

11:22.320 --> 11:24.200
Stop pretending to be faithful.

11:33.080 --> 11:34.080
Su Chengcheng.

11:34.680 --> 11:36.160
Do you have a problem?

11:37.600 --> 11:40.160
No, I wouldn't dare.

11:45.120 --> 11:47.760
Oh, what year is it?

11:47.840 --> 11:49.400
- 2024.
- 2024.

11:52.480 --> 11:53.880
According to research,

11:53.960 --> 11:56.880
there is a chemosensory organ in our nose

11:56.960 --> 11:58.960
called the vomeronasal organ.

11:59.600 --> 12:02.440
It can detect very subtle pheromones.

12:03.120 --> 12:05.360
When you sense the pheromones,

12:06.240 --> 12:09.080
the vomeronasal organ will increase
blood flow and electrical activity

12:09.160 --> 12:12.000
in the area of your brain
responsible for sexual activity,

12:12.600 --> 12:15.040
transmitting signals
to the central nervous system.

12:15.120 --> 12:17.120
Dr. Tang, what will happen?

12:17.880 --> 12:20.000
The heart will beat faster.

12:20.080 --> 12:23.680
Which means you're having a crush.

12:26.400 --> 12:29.080
Therefore, when you have a crush,

12:29.160 --> 12:32.160
it's not controlled by your heart
but by your nose.

12:32.760 --> 12:34.720
When you smell the pheromones,

12:34.800 --> 12:38.280
you'll fall in love.

12:40.360 --> 12:42.480
- Shit.
- Mr. Gu, amazing.

12:42.560 --> 12:43.880
It's impressive.

12:44.800 --> 12:45.840
It's 2024.

12:45.920 --> 12:47.280
Please believe in science, okay?

12:48.520 --> 12:50.400
You two, finish your drinks.

12:57.480 --> 12:59.400
WHOEVER YOU POINT AT GETS RICH

13:01.800 --> 13:03.040
We're leaving.

13:04.680 --> 13:06.000
Listen,

13:06.520 --> 13:09.560
the vomeronasal organ is like magic.

13:09.640 --> 13:12.040
- Mr. Gu, wonderful speech.
- Well, it's like…

13:12.120 --> 13:14.000
Mr. Gu. Mr. Gu.

13:14.080 --> 13:16.200
I gave your car key
to the designated driver

13:16.880 --> 13:18.280
and sent you the order.

13:18.360 --> 13:20.160
Really? You're efficient.

13:20.880 --> 13:21.880
Let me see.

13:23.000 --> 13:23.920
Okay.

13:24.000 --> 13:27.120
I'll wait for my car and leave.

13:27.200 --> 13:28.160
Okay.

13:29.760 --> 13:31.320
What about the bill?

13:31.400 --> 13:32.560
Mr. Gu, don't worry.

13:32.640 --> 13:33.920
Don't worry about it.

13:36.280 --> 13:37.480
Mr. Gu, your car.

13:37.560 --> 13:39.040
That's my car.

13:39.640 --> 13:40.680
Then I'm leaving.

13:41.720 --> 13:43.160
- Bye, Mr. Gu.
- Bye.

13:50.280 --> 13:52.000
Shuangxi Garden, Jingshan Road.

13:55.400 --> 13:56.720
Sir, you're in the wrong car.

13:57.320 --> 13:59.200
How's that possible? It's my car.

13:59.280 --> 14:01.120
My surname is Gu.
My last four digits are 8392.

14:01.880 --> 14:04.440
- It can't be wrong.
- I don't care what your number is.

14:04.520 --> 14:05.400
Get out now.

14:06.800 --> 14:08.200
Check the order.

14:08.280 --> 14:10.560
No one wants to see it. Get out.

14:11.680 --> 14:14.280
Get out! Get out!

14:14.920 --> 14:16.360
Get out…

14:18.280 --> 14:20.840
Please leave. You can't park here.
Hurry up and leave.

14:20.920 --> 14:22.480
- I got it. I got it.
- Hurry up.

14:46.400 --> 14:48.800
I'm warning you. Don't throw up in my car.

15:00.840 --> 15:02.280
Don't throw up!

15:09.320 --> 15:11.520
Stop it!

15:19.840 --> 15:21.680
Hello. Where are you?

15:21.760 --> 15:23.280
Can I go out now?

15:23.360 --> 15:25.240
Sorry, I can't pick you up.

15:25.880 --> 15:27.720
A psycho threw up in my car.

15:27.800 --> 15:29.880
Stop!

15:34.280 --> 15:36.080
It's okay. I'll call a taxi.

15:36.160 --> 15:38.080
What happened?

15:43.520 --> 15:44.600
Young girl.

15:51.240 --> 15:52.960
You're so hard-working.

15:54.240 --> 15:56.840
This is my car,

15:57.680 --> 15:59.320
and you're more anxious.

16:02.600 --> 16:04.200
He's a hoodoo!

16:04.280 --> 16:05.760
Talk to you later.

16:09.920 --> 16:11.520
Stop!

16:11.600 --> 16:13.400
I'm going to throw up!

16:15.520 --> 16:16.960
I'll wash my car first.

16:17.800 --> 16:18.640
Be careful.

16:18.720 --> 16:21.040
You too. Be careful.

16:22.240 --> 16:24.120
Call me if anything happens.

16:27.840 --> 16:28.880
HOME

16:28.960 --> 16:30.760
DIDI

16:33.760 --> 16:36.080
SHARE

16:38.760 --> 16:40.920
DEAR CHENG

16:41.000 --> 16:42.520
YOUR FRIEND'S CAR IS ARRIVING.

16:55.360 --> 16:56.240
Miss,

16:56.800 --> 16:58.240
we're closed.

16:58.320 --> 17:00.160
Yes, I'm leaving.

17:00.240 --> 17:01.520
What about him?

17:05.040 --> 17:06.319
We're not close.

17:07.000 --> 17:08.319
I don't know him at all.

17:20.920 --> 17:22.839
- I'll help you carry him.
- No need.

17:30.880 --> 17:32.600
Remarkable.

18:16.040 --> 18:17.040
Nightmare.

18:18.240 --> 18:19.600
It must be a nightmare.

19:04.960 --> 19:06.040
Unlocked.

20:05.760 --> 20:06.960
Who are you?

20:10.200 --> 20:12.200
Who are you? This is my house.

20:26.160 --> 20:27.720
You're awake. Good morning.

20:29.880 --> 20:31.000
Good morning…

20:31.800 --> 20:33.160
You haven't had breakfast, right?

20:36.120 --> 20:37.080
No.

20:38.960 --> 20:40.280
Does your head hurt?

20:41.640 --> 20:43.360
You must eat something after a hangover.

20:43.440 --> 20:45.040
Have some porridge and honey water.

20:46.640 --> 20:47.560
I have to go.

20:48.160 --> 20:49.000
Bye.

20:51.480 --> 20:52.600
Bye.

22:39.600 --> 22:44.440
ANGEL SU

22:47.400 --> 22:50.960
ANGEL SU

23:17.760 --> 23:19.000
Hello.

23:19.080 --> 23:20.440
It's early. What's the matter?

23:22.320 --> 23:25.200
I slept with someone

23:27.600 --> 23:28.800
after I got drunk.

23:29.600 --> 23:30.920
Man or woman?

23:31.000 --> 23:31.880
Woman.

23:39.680 --> 23:41.760
You slept with a woman?

23:43.680 --> 23:44.520
What else?

23:46.800 --> 23:50.160
I… I don't know.

23:50.760 --> 23:54.320
I only know we held each other.

23:55.040 --> 23:58.160
I can't remember anything else.

23:59.200 --> 24:01.240
Do you need to see a therapist?

24:02.960 --> 24:04.240
I'm feeling dizzy

24:05.240 --> 24:06.480
and exhausted.

24:08.480 --> 24:10.280
I got red marks on my body.

24:10.360 --> 24:11.760
Do I need to see a therapist?

24:12.840 --> 24:14.680
Oh, no need.

24:14.760 --> 24:15.800
You're fine.

24:16.680 --> 24:17.680
Do you know her?

24:18.400 --> 24:20.160
Is it Su Miao?

24:21.960 --> 24:23.040
Yes.

24:25.320 --> 24:26.320
What was she like?

24:27.840 --> 24:29.760
Calm and kind.

24:31.600 --> 24:35.120
She asked me to have breakfast
when she left.

24:36.320 --> 24:37.480
Not a big deal.

24:38.160 --> 24:40.000
You're both adults.

24:40.080 --> 24:42.000
As long as it's consensual,
you don't need to worry.

24:44.240 --> 24:46.200
Of course, you're both single.

24:46.280 --> 24:48.680
If you want more, you can do something.

24:48.760 --> 24:49.600
Hey.

24:50.640 --> 24:51.720
Did you sleep well?

24:53.280 --> 24:54.880
Not bad.

24:54.960 --> 24:56.320
It seems my driving skills are too good.

24:58.600 --> 24:59.640
I won't bother you.

25:00.240 --> 25:01.160
Bye.

25:02.600 --> 25:04.320
Hello? Hello?

26:06.280 --> 26:07.680
Even if it's the same type,

26:07.760 --> 26:09.560
can the plate number be the same?

26:11.040 --> 26:12.480
I'm so sorry.

26:12.560 --> 26:14.160
I was too drunk

26:14.240 --> 26:16.760
to check the plate,
so I got in the wrong car.

26:17.320 --> 26:18.840
Is that all?

26:31.120 --> 26:32.760
I… I threw up?

26:33.400 --> 26:35.920
Do you know how much time
I spent cleaning this up?

26:37.680 --> 26:38.600
Calm down.

26:38.680 --> 26:39.840
It's my fault.

26:39.920 --> 26:42.400
Two hundred yuan for washing the car,
98 yuan for driving,

26:42.480 --> 26:43.880
888 yuan for the stay,

26:43.960 --> 26:45.600
500 yuan for moral damages,

26:45.680 --> 26:47.080
and five yuan for the water.

26:47.160 --> 26:48.800
It's 1,691 yuan in total.

26:51.760 --> 26:52.880
Nothing else?

26:54.480 --> 26:56.280
- What?
- Your WeChat.

26:58.560 --> 26:59.600
Are you hitting on me?

27:02.960 --> 27:03.800
I want…

27:03.880 --> 27:05.280
to transfer the money through WeChat.

27:11.400 --> 27:12.240
Go ahead.

27:13.880 --> 27:15.480
I'll transfer 1,700 yuan.

27:18.320 --> 27:19.480
What?

27:30.560 --> 27:32.120
My phone died.

27:32.200 --> 27:35.040
Why don't you take the 200 yuan?

27:35.120 --> 27:37.360
When my phone is charged,
I'll transfer it to you.

27:41.440 --> 27:42.640
Don't try to escape.

27:42.720 --> 27:44.000
I've kept all the evidence.

27:44.640 --> 27:45.840
Of course.

28:06.840 --> 28:10.040
Miss, my phone died, and I have no money.

28:10.120 --> 28:12.800
Can you call a ride to my company for me?

28:13.920 --> 28:16.640
Fine, the calling service is 200 yuan,
car fare not included.

28:17.640 --> 28:18.720
Then call a premier car.

28:18.800 --> 28:20.200
I can charge my phone.

28:26.480 --> 28:27.480
Thanks.

28:30.560 --> 28:31.480
Premier.

28:47.880 --> 28:48.840
SCRATCH-OFF

29:02.960 --> 29:03.960
YOU WON 200 CHINESE YUAN,
SECURITY AREA INVALID IF SCRATCHED

29:04.040 --> 29:05.280
Two hundred yuan?

29:07.720 --> 29:09.280
I'm so lucky.

29:23.800 --> 29:24.880
Wait a minute!

29:27.120 --> 29:27.960
Good morning.

29:40.800 --> 29:42.360
You didn't go home last night?

29:44.160 --> 29:46.120
You remember? I can explain.

29:46.200 --> 29:48.040
It's not my business.

29:49.920 --> 29:51.320
But please take a shower.

29:51.400 --> 29:53.360
You smell like barbecue.

29:59.960 --> 30:01.240
NEVER STOP

30:11.880 --> 30:14.080
You didn't come home last night.
Where were you?

30:14.720 --> 30:16.840
I'm going to be late! Talk to you later.

30:29.360 --> 30:30.280
Mr. Tang,

30:30.920 --> 30:32.720
what happened last night?

30:32.800 --> 30:34.040
You dressed up like this.

30:37.040 --> 30:37.880
None of your business.

30:57.240 --> 30:58.080
Scum.

30:58.720 --> 31:00.960
Luckily, Su Miao took the blame.

31:01.040 --> 31:02.560
Otherwise, I'd lose this job.

31:15.600 --> 31:17.520
You didn't maintain
a constant temperature.

31:17.600 --> 31:20.160
Sorry, I made a mistake. I'll do it again.

31:20.920 --> 31:24.760
When stirred, titanium dioxide
nanoparticles will rub against the ball

31:24.840 --> 31:27.160
and generate heat,
causing the material to overheat,

31:27.240 --> 31:31.000
which affects its dispersion
and leads to clumping.

31:31.080 --> 31:33.760
If it's not dispersed,
it can't be evenly applied.

31:33.840 --> 31:35.760
So, when stirring the material,

31:36.880 --> 31:38.840
you can't let it overheat.

31:39.360 --> 31:41.320
You must maintain a constant temperature.

31:46.800 --> 31:49.400
I have a meeting.
Be careful with the operations.

31:49.480 --> 31:50.520
- Okay.
- Okay.

31:57.560 --> 31:59.160
Mr. Tang is in a good mood.

31:59.240 --> 32:00.080
Yes.

32:00.160 --> 32:03.520
He stressed it yesterday,
and we made a mistake today.

32:03.600 --> 32:05.000
I thought he'd scold us.

32:15.560 --> 32:17.840
Hello, Mr. Gu. Where are you?

32:17.920 --> 32:19.120
The meeting has started.

32:19.880 --> 32:21.000
Open the screen.

32:21.080 --> 32:23.400
Ask them to check
the info about the poster.

32:23.480 --> 32:24.440
Okay.

32:44.400 --> 32:45.240
THOUSAND BIRDS COLLECTION

32:45.320 --> 32:46.480
STARLIGHT EYESHADOW

33:08.840 --> 33:09.880
We got the poster.

33:09.960 --> 33:11.160
Do you want to see it?

33:22.400 --> 33:23.640
As you can see,

33:23.720 --> 33:25.400
it's amazing.

33:25.960 --> 33:28.040
Thanks for all your hard work.

33:33.720 --> 33:35.840
Starlight Eyeshadow will be launched soon.

33:35.920 --> 33:37.400
We must keep it exposed.

33:38.160 --> 33:41.200
The Marketing Department
will pair up in teams of two

33:41.280 --> 33:42.680
and submit a promotion plan.

33:42.760 --> 33:44.120
If you have different ideas,

33:44.200 --> 33:46.360
you can also submit two plans.

33:48.200 --> 33:50.000
We still have a lot of work to do.

33:50.080 --> 33:51.760
Keep it up.

33:51.840 --> 33:53.120
- Okay!
- Okay!

33:55.280 --> 33:57.240
Lastly, I have something to say.

33:57.920 --> 34:01.160
Thanks to Su Chengcheng's
great performance,

34:01.240 --> 34:03.200
we went through
the crisis of the poster shooting.

34:03.800 --> 34:06.560
So, we've decided to officially hire her.

34:09.080 --> 34:11.520
Well, you're now a member
of Thousand Birds Collection.

34:14.440 --> 34:16.199
Thanks, Mr. Zhou. Thanks, Mr. Gu.

34:19.239 --> 34:20.199
Thank you.

34:20.280 --> 34:22.400
I'll try my best.

34:40.320 --> 34:41.520
Great!

35:02.640 --> 35:04.720
Su Chengcheng
has been playing little tricks

35:04.800 --> 35:06.080
to slack off.

35:07.080 --> 35:09.760
I thought she was just an intern

35:09.840 --> 35:11.520
and would leave the company soon.

35:12.200 --> 35:14.920
However, she got hired in advance.

35:15.000 --> 35:16.640
Don't be upset.

35:16.720 --> 35:19.240
Someone like her
doesn't suit our department.

35:19.320 --> 35:21.040
She managed to get in
by using her connections,

35:21.120 --> 35:23.040
but she can't stay for long.

35:23.920 --> 35:27.240
Mr. Gu often told us
we're the face of the company,

35:27.320 --> 35:28.960
so we must look good.

35:29.560 --> 35:31.680
How did Su Chengcheng get in?

35:33.200 --> 35:36.920
I think her friend Su Miao
is more suitable for this position.

35:37.960 --> 35:39.760
She's kind and hard-working,

35:40.480 --> 35:43.520
so if she can come,
I'll be energetic every day.

36:26.240 --> 36:30.320
It's okay for that scum to pursue Su Miao,

36:30.400 --> 36:32.960
but everyone thinks she's better.

36:34.000 --> 36:35.760
Aren't you Su Miao?

36:35.840 --> 36:37.880
They were complimenting you.

36:39.680 --> 36:41.960
Are Su Miao and I the same person?

36:42.040 --> 36:44.440
Swans and geese are the same species.

36:44.520 --> 36:46.560
The former is protected by law,

36:47.160 --> 36:49.720
whereas the other is food.

36:53.720 --> 36:56.040
You seem to hate Su Miao.

36:57.880 --> 36:59.400
I do.

37:00.000 --> 37:01.320
Why?

37:02.680 --> 37:03.640
Jealous.

37:04.680 --> 37:06.600
No matter if it's Tang Qi or work,

37:06.680 --> 37:08.680
I tried so hard yet blew up everything.

37:08.760 --> 37:11.320
However, Su Miao
can get compliments easily.

37:11.400 --> 37:13.080
If we were two different people,

37:13.160 --> 37:16.320
I'd accept that because she
must have something unique.

37:16.400 --> 37:18.360
However, we're clearly the same person,

37:18.440 --> 37:20.160
and everyone likes her but hates me

37:20.240 --> 37:21.920
just because of our appearances.

37:22.000 --> 37:23.600
Are we really that different?

37:23.680 --> 37:25.040
It's so unfair.

37:26.160 --> 37:28.440
Time tries all.

37:28.520 --> 37:31.360
I believe their misunderstanding
about you is just temporary.

37:31.440 --> 37:33.200
They'll accept you sooner or later.

37:34.080 --> 37:35.760
Exactly. Don't worry.

37:35.840 --> 37:37.120
Not a big deal.

37:37.920 --> 37:41.240
With my strength, I can easily solve it.

37:43.440 --> 37:44.520
I'll take this.

37:46.440 --> 37:47.840
ER GUAN

37:51.040 --> 37:51.880
Who is it?

37:51.960 --> 37:54.400
It's the scumbag. He's calling Su Miao.

37:55.000 --> 37:56.920
Why is he still calling her?

37:57.000 --> 37:58.280
Didn't they finish shooting?

38:00.120 --> 38:04.280
It seems I caused trouble for Su Miao.

38:12.800 --> 38:14.600
She didn't answer my calls
or reply to my messages.

38:17.520 --> 38:21.560
Maybe she's shy
and doesn't know how to face you.

38:21.640 --> 38:24.520
Maybe it was just a one-night stand.

38:24.600 --> 38:26.200
She doesn't want more.

38:36.880 --> 38:38.320
What are you going to do?

38:42.760 --> 38:45.560
I met her by accident,
yet I can't forget her.

38:47.320 --> 38:51.080
I want to see her again,
yet the road is long and tough.

38:52.320 --> 38:55.720
If I marry her, I shall play her music

38:58.360 --> 38:59.480
to make her happy.

39:01.080 --> 39:02.440
You want to marry her?

39:04.520 --> 39:07.160
I want to pursue her
with the intention of marriage.

39:08.760 --> 39:09.840
You want to marry her.

39:11.960 --> 39:15.280
If you want to pursue her,
I'll support you.

39:16.120 --> 39:19.240
But as for marriage,
shouldn't you be more cautious?

39:19.320 --> 39:21.960
Su Miao is pretty, but marriage
is not just about appearance.

39:23.320 --> 39:25.440
I didn't fall in love because of her face.

39:26.120 --> 39:28.200
Then why didn't you want
to marry Su Chengcheng?

39:29.840 --> 39:31.040
What?

39:31.120 --> 39:33.960
I know you've kept your virginity.

39:34.600 --> 39:36.160
But it's modern times.

39:36.240 --> 39:38.480
Maybe you broke the rule once,

39:38.560 --> 39:40.080
but you can't turn a small mistake

39:40.160 --> 39:42.160
into a lifelong regret, right?

39:45.800 --> 39:48.400
We only slept on the same bed by accident.

39:48.480 --> 39:49.640
Nothing happened.

39:49.720 --> 39:52.040
Just pure sleeping partners,

39:52.120 --> 39:53.920
like studying partners
or driving partners.

39:54.920 --> 39:56.960
No wonder Tang Qi wants to see Su Miao.

40:00.640 --> 40:02.960
I'll never let him see her again.

40:03.040 --> 40:04.240
I want to see her.

40:15.680 --> 40:17.240
Here's the sales data
of all eyeshadow products

40:17.320 --> 40:18.760
for the last five years.

40:19.360 --> 40:22.160
Organize and analyze the materials
and make a report.

40:23.360 --> 40:24.360
When do you need it?

40:24.960 --> 40:26.240
Tomorrow before work.

40:29.720 --> 40:30.560
Okay.

40:32.120 --> 40:33.360
If our work is delayed

40:33.440 --> 40:35.720
because of you,
you'll be fully responsible.

41:16.520 --> 41:18.680
TANG QI: HELLO?

41:29.160 --> 41:30.880
TANG QI: CAN YOU REPLY TO ME?

41:37.880 --> 41:39.760
TANG QI: WHEN WILL YOU BE FREE?

41:43.840 --> 41:45.440
ER GUAN

41:49.920 --> 41:50.960
ER GUAN

41:51.640 --> 41:54.600
The subscriber you dialed
cannot be connected for the moment…

41:56.000 --> 41:58.000
CARD 2

42:40.920 --> 42:42.880
WHEN WILL YOU BE FREE?

42:42.960 --> 42:44.320
When will you be free?

42:45.680 --> 42:46.960
Can we meet in person?

44:54.520 --> 44:55.800
TURN OFF, VOICE CHANGE
BEAUTY FILTER, OUTFIT, EFFECT
